      "id": "60000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000114",
      "topicId": "60000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000604",
      "title": {
        "en": "Email requests",
        "de": "Bitten per E-Mail"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The finite verb is second in these statements; the infinitive comes last.",
        "de": "In diesen Aussagesätzen steht das finite Verb an zweiter Stelle; der Infinitiv steht am Ende."
      },
      "level": "B1",
      "learningContext": "work"
    },
    {
      "id": "60000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000115",
      "topicId": "60000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000600",
      "title": {
        "en": "Although clauses",
